Query: mod_rsi LB+HA strategy (21-10-2026): the rolling NIFTY 1-min cache lives on the VM in mod_rsi/data_cache/; a Mac copy must never be uploaded over it, and the exclude must apply ONLY to mod_rsi uploads (not the shared UPLOAD_OPTS).
